{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9aadcdb3f8f8f0be8277824de19f30480ce51bca148a68a0e640f3e8cc06489e", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n瑞希と一緒に、ちょっと早めに現地入りした）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。\n和瑞希一起提前了一会儿到达现场。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "401e973ea61e0caec9bbf661b62bf600a7172136a09c56fb9a649eb6bbe48879", "ja": "よし……やるぞ、瑞希。\n東京特許きょきゃきょきゅ……ダメだ。", "zh": "好……上吧，瑞希。\n东京特许きょきゃきょきゅ……不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6f7a112a571818e35275667bb3e00f7a6077d3e1fa8bc3383270a5bd2e2081da", "ja": "瑞希？　どうしたんだ？", "zh": "瑞希？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "0af9b4626eaa62e1c703d8aee6c66093f6328607c1de1d56bffaf582eece136b", "ja": "あ、{$P$}……。\nはい、今日の仕事のために、早口言葉の練習を。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……\n嗯，为了今天的工作，正在练习绕口令。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1004_p", "source_sha256": "439207534a274cfa768652e1eac06ec9f2568c91172c441c1015fd0642363141", "ja": "えっ、グラビア撮影で、早口言葉……？", "zh": "诶？拍写真的时候还要练绕口令……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "d40b3475180757d7993639a4a74a8d060d087050168baf8be32e3e7ce9e6d714", "ja": "今日の私は、生徒会長という設定だそうです。\nなので、生徒会長になりきらなければ。", "zh": "听说今天的我设定是学生会长。\n所以，必须完全融入学生会长这个角色才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "c62ca681b313f17b722fdda0c3a384906774871b827d87d30534704b74781ee8", "ja": "会長となると、みんなの前で喋る事が多いです。\n祝辞や送辞、表彰式のスピーチや……いっぱい。", "zh": "身为会长，就会经常需要在大家面前讲话。\n祝词、送别词、颁奖仪式上的致辞……有很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e758293431e806e6e5388fcb327b45640e545a27cd7afd3e1908061e179af6b6", "ja": "なるほど、それで早口言葉か。\nイメージトレーニングは、確かに重要かもな。", "zh": "原来如此，所以才练绕口令啊。\n形象训练，确实可能很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "89a950e618f59c0026886e1bad1e553cbb98321af8882368598c20c905de43d4", "ja": "はい。でも、なかなか上手くいきません。\n生徒会長、落選です……しゅん。", "zh": "是的。不过，进展得不太顺利。\n学生会长落选了……好沮丧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1009_p", "source_sha256": "248aa162812150d107710b55c852bc2dce27c229afba6d2510e4bd3be4a281ea", "ja": "いや……生徒会長は、早口言葉は言わないと思うぞ。\n普通にスピーチとかやってみたらどうだ？", "zh": "不对……我觉得学生会长不会说绕口令吧。\n要不要试着正常演讲之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "24a20a9cc95eb433472dfea2a217158b3a2966b5ecd9b59bd8b1e1b7526ca706", "ja": "はっ、そういえば……。\n早口言葉にこだわりすぎていました。", "zh": "啊，说起来……我太执着于绕口令了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "f03a3b8c520f87bb1aa0928ec9843f37ea4c1a6407743c96be40b95f951bee59", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\nそれでは、表彰式をやってみます。聞いてくれますか？", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}。\n那么，我来试着主持一下颁奖典礼。您可以听一听吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1012_p", "source_sha256": "900b9628d35c859e7703509fbe5f1b34cbdbd96dcfd44796a9f62e99531e2cdf", "ja": "もちろん、聞かせてもらうよ。", "zh": "当然了，我听着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "822743f85116c88976542f87b6de2018173b2f110c48007b96b3ae535d49bcea", "ja": "では、いきます……ゴクリ。\nひょうしょうぞう。そつぎょうそうそ……ダメかー。", "zh": "那么，我要开始了……咕咚。\n表彰葬。毕业搜嗦……还是不行吗——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1014_p", "source_sha256": "54150464c4de218f5369530e56f841c6d708dfdd0cb9e22ff276b86eb8355634", "ja": "いや、早口言葉じゃないんだから。\nもうちょっとゆっくり発音してみたらどうだ？", "zh": "不是绕口令啊。\n要不再慢一点发音试试？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "4d841a5d2d9d60677775e633231ba3e90a0308667abe1a2cdef6f828ff9f3819", "ja": "なるほど、確かに。では……。\n表彰状、卒業証書……やったぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "原来如此，确实。那就……  \n表彰状，毕业证书……我做到了，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1016_p", "source_sha256": "68fb113fdebe08adb6667354d58982f5f44efe94c30312235f5618d467610089", "ja": "うん、言えてる、言えてる！", "zh": "嗯，念得很顺，很顺嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "f9ba1ae246874ba5ecb902f0604da39e146013286d5e6c7c7b9d651a025776e5", "ja": "ありがとうございます。{$P$}の\nおかげで、自信が持てました……イエイ。", "zh": "谢谢您。多亏了{$P$}，\n让我有了自信……耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c070472a2e08f3ce15c8ad314aa574210ac3a5e36ca034e303dad195fda91bae", "ja": "それならよかった。\nじゃあそろそろ、スタンバイしようか。", "zh": "那就好。那我们差不多该准备上场了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "a0b2cfe8281c9cac3bad89c5259fb66cdbd12a20e183d855bc940308172a011b", "ja": "あ……{$P$}。\nもう1回だけ、いいでしょうか？", "zh": "啊……{$P$}。\n再来1次，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1020_p", "source_sha256": "fe93ce11bc34f811d28180fe120debb93d73c675ee91967d7c3762de6c72fc57", "ja": "え？　うん、まだ時間はあるけど……。", "zh": "诶？嗯，虽然还有时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "5eb3ba93278f04afe9b8b0d208ce6ab790083b7740ec0543bbcc9bf203b53c74", "ja": "では……こほん。\n表彰状。{$P$}どの。", "zh": "那么……咳咳。\n\n表彰状，致{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0163_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "b07b9672343ac0a8da1c7be6f69ffebbb6e2b0fd3479db7736eddff57773eb83", "ja": "あなたは素晴らしいプロデュースをしてくれたので、\nここに表彰します。生徒会長、真壁瑞希。", "zh": "鉴于您展现出了出色的制作能力，\n特此表彰。学生会长，真壁瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
